{
  "id": "dlg.arne_intro",
  "speaker": "Arne",
  "start": "greet",
  "nodes": {
    "greet": {
      "text": [
        "Mind the water, the bank gives way.",
        "Anything you need hammered, I am here till dusk."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "What do you make?",
          "goto": "wares"
        },
        {
          "text": "Any work going?",
          "goto": "work",
          "when": {
            "noflag": "arne.wants_ore"
          },
          "set": "arne.wants_ore"
        },
        {
          "text": "I have your ore.",
          "goto": "deliver",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "flag": "arne.wants_ore"
              },
              {
                "noflag": "arne.gave_key"
              },
              {
                "has": "item.ore"
              }
            ]
          },
          "take": "item.ore",
          "give": "item.key",
          "set": "arne.gave_key"
        },
        {
          "text": "Still looking for that ore.",
          "goto": "waiting",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "flag": "arne.wants_ore"
              },
              {
                "noflag": "arne.gave_key"
              },
              {
                "nothas": "item.ore"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "About that chest.",
          "goto": "chest_talk",
          "when": {
            "flag": "arne.gave_key"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Nothing. Good day."
        }
      ]
    },
    "wares": {
      "text": [
        "Nails, hinges, a blade now and then.",
        "The one by the anvil is spoken for. Lift it if you think you can."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Something else.",
          "goto": "greet"
        },
        {
          "text": "I should go."
        }
      ]
    },
    "work": {
      "text": [
        "As it happens. The quarry west of the crossroads has iron in it - red in the grey.",
        "Bring me a lump and I will make it worth the walk."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "I'll have a look."
        }
      ]
    },
    "waiting": {
      "text": [
        "West of the crossroads. Red in the grey. You will not miss it."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Right."
        }
      ]
    },
    "deliver": {
      "text": [
        "Good weight on that. It will do.",
        "Here - the key to the chest in the barn yard.",
        "It was my father's. I never had the stomach for what is in it."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Thank you.",
          "goto": "greet"
        }
      ]
    },
    "chest_talk": {
      "text": [
        "Open it. Whatever is in there has waited long enough."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "I will.",
          "goto": "greet"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
